      "source_text": "Excited to share that my PR for RotorPy support has been merged into PX4! RotorPy is a lightweight Python-based multirotor simulator with aerodynamic modeling and a Gymnasium interface, making it a useful option for simulation, research, and ML/AI workflows. The integration is now part of PX4 main and includes SITL support and documentation to get started. Docs: https://lnkd.in/eYjwYdyj PR: PX4 PR #27116 https://lnkd.in/eCRMaHZS Thanks to the PX4 community for the reviews and contributions! #PX4 #RotorPy #Robotics #Drones #Simulation #Autonomy #MachineLearning",
