      "source_text": "🎓 MATLAB DAY at Anurag University - A Day of Learning, Innovation & Engineering Excellence! We are pleased to share that MATLAB DAY at Anurag University was successfully conducted by the ARKANCE Education Team, with an enthusiastic response from 200+ students and faculty members across core engineering disciplines. The full-day technical program provided participants with valuable insights into the MathWorks Campus-Wide License, MATLAB & Simulink, academic learning resources, and applications across engineering domains. ✨ Key highlights included: • Introduction to MATLAB, Simulink & Campus-Wide License • Live technical demonstrations across engineering applications • MATLAB Academic Online Training & self-learning resources • Software installation and access guidance • Interactive Q&A with students and faculty A special thanks to our ARKANCE team - P Chandhana , uday Kumar , Naresh Babu , and Francis Arokia Swamy - for successfully planning and delivering the program. We sincerely thank Ajay Talluri and Loy Sabson Fernandes from MathWorks for their continued support and guidance. Together, MathWorks, Anurag University & ARKANCE continue to empower the next generation of engineers with industry-relevant tools, knowledge, and learning opportunities. #MATLABDay #MATLAB #Simulink #MathWorks #AnuragUniversity #ARKANCE #EngineeringEducation #EngineeringStudents #TechnicalEducation #Innovation #AcademicTechnology #ARKANCEIndia",
